r of 2026, generating $3.8 billion in net income. L109: cite64†Outlook January 24, 2025 Economic, Housing and Mortgage Market Outlook – January 2025 The U.S. economy grew at a stronger pace than initially estimated in the third quarter of 2024 while the labor market remains resilient. L110: \nL111:   *   *   *   *   *   *   *   * ## Media Contact\nL112: \nL113: For Press Inquiries Only\nL114: Phone: (703) 903-3933\nL115: Email: cite65†[email protected] L116: \nL117: For non-press inquiries, visit our cite66†FAQs page.\nL118: \nL119:   *   *   *   *   *   *   * ## Join Us In Making Home Possible\nL120: Freddie Mac is where ambitious possibility-makers and relentless doers are shaping the U.S. housing industry.\nL121: \nL122: cite54†Learn More†careers.freddiemac.com L123: ## Search for Career Opportunities\nL124: \nL125: Search our open opportunities and discover how you can help drive our business forward.\nL126: \nL127: cite55†Job Search†careers.freddiemac.com L128: \nL129: Enter your search [Input: Enter your search]\nL130: \nL131: [Button: Search]\nL132: \nL133: # Mortgage Market Survey Archive\nL134: ## Compilation of Weekly Survey Data for 2024\nL135: \nL136: cite67†Current Mortgage Rates Data Since 1971 L137: \nL138: December 26, 2024\nL139: \nL140:  | 30-Yr FRM  | 15-Yr FRM\nL141: --- | --- | ---\nL142: Average Rates  | 6.85%  | 6.00%\nL143: \nL144: December 19, 2024\nL145: \nL146:  | 30-Yr FRM  | 15-Yr FRM\nL147: --- | --- | ---\nL148: Average Rates  | 6.72%  | 5.92%\nL149: \nL150: December 12, 2024\nL151: \nL152:  | 30-Yr FRM  | 15-Yr FRM\nL153: --- | --- | ---\nL154: Average Rates  | 6.60%  | 5.84%\nL155: \nL156: December 05, 2024\nL157: \nL158:  | 30-Yr FRM  | 15-Yr FRM\nL159: --- | --- | ---\nL160: Average Rates  | 6.69%  | 5.96%\nL161: \nL162: November 27, 2024\nL163:  | 30-Yr FRM  | 15-Yr FRM\nL164: --- | --- | ---\nL165: Average Rates  | 6.81%  | 6.10%\nL166: \nL167: November 21, 2024\nL168: \nL169:  | 30-Yr FRM  | 15-Yr FRM\nL170: -